 + open head: return · U-loop: self-message · thin bar: activation · grey pentagon frame: combined fragment (alt / opt / loop / par / break / ref) with [guard] · pill {…}: state invariant. Colours: blue = human actor, green = Gonarra component (CMP-xxx, SAD §3.1.1), yellow = data store or «external» system (SAD §2.5). [FR-/NFR-] = requirement satisfied (PRD 0.1). SSE events emitted by a module travel through the API router (CMP-003) and Caddy (CMP-015); the router hop is not repeated." style="fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1190" width="1345" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>

